    "title": "Copper Country Snowsports Club earn places on the podium at pre-season event in Canada - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Thomas Fournier ,\n1 days ago Copper Country Snowsports Club skiers place earn a place at the podium during a recent competition in Canada. Recently the Copper Country Snowsports Club was included in a race in Searchmont, Canada, where the club had two skiers earn 1st place finishes in their races. Additionally the club saw one skier earn a 2nd place finish, and added 3 more podium places with another three skiers earning 3rd in their events. The race over the weekend was a pre-season event. Conditions on the hill included -15 degree temperatures and head on winds during the international competition. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
